Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:06.20,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Fitting, but it ends in such fashion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N以这样的方式结束 也很贴切
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.85,0:00:10.54,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}阿卡的反扑 停在抢七最后关头
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:15.85,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's not always easy to hit a drop shot on the surface like this.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这种场地 放小球并不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.95,0:00:17.86,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}12{\fs68}日晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.86,0:00:20.12,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}上海大师赛第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.25,0:00:24.45,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Executed brilliantly.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N执行得太漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.35,0:00:27.65,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's going to work so well on the quick court.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在快速球场上 这一招会很管用
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.87,0:00:29.95,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}贝尔格斯用网前放短拿分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.95,0:00:32.08,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}迫使阿卡向前追球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.08,0:00:33.34,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}东京夺冠之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.34,0:00:36.22,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他在上海遭遇新的考验
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.28,0:00:42.03,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sublime.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.23,0:00:43.84,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}首盘{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.84,0:00:46.73,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}阿卡立即回破 追成{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.73,0:00:49.29,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}之后 再次丢掉发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.29,0:00:51.59,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68}输掉首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.98,0:01:02.72,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's had a few looks already in this match, has Bergs.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N贝尔格斯这场已经多次看到机会了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.75,0:01:05.50,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's been an ever-present in Alcaraz's service games.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿卡的发球局 他一直在施压
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.60,0:01:10.82,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, that's wide.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 出界了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.60,0:01:24.30,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A rather tepid end to the opening set from Carlos Alcaraz, who blew hot and cold.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿卡首盘收尾乏力 起伏很大
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.53,0:01:26.89,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第二盘 贝尔格斯打出穿越
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.89,0:01:29.21,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}突破阿卡的网前防线
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.21,0:01:32.26,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}双方保发 悬念拖到盘末
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.65,0:01:36.00,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a strike that was.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一击太漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.60,0:01:39.50,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Not easy to get the ball by Alcaraz when he comes in.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿卡上网后 想穿越他并不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.95,0:01:41.25,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And he did it beautifully.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他却完成得非常漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.35,0:01:44.86,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 阿卡保住发球局 {\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.86,0:01:48.74,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}握拳 怒吼 他还不肯让这场球结束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.16,0:01:53.86,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And a strong reaction.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N反应也非常强烈
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.25,0:01:57.11,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}对手同样保发 追到{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.11,0:01:59.20,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}盘末的拉锯 谁先松手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:01.23,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}谁就陷入危险
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.41,0:02:05.26,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}World class.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N世界级的一击
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.56,0:02:19.36,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A forehand that has been, at times, porous this evening here in Shanghai.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N今晚在上海 他的正手屡屡出错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.31,0:02:29.72,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}15{\fs68}比{\fs78}40{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.72,0:02:31.93,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}阿卡又到悬崖边上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.93,0:02:34.01,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他守住这次机会 回破
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.01,0:02:36.38,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}把比赛拉回{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:38.66,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Incredible!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太不可思议了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.51,0:02:44.95,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}一发得分率 阿卡{\fs78}66{\fs68}% 对手{\fs78}79{\fs68}%
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.95,0:02:46.83,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}制胜分少了{\fs78}8{\fs68}个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.83,0:02:50.37,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}下一站 他能把反扑变成胜利吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.86,0:03:00.06,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Just ask Arthur Fery about that.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N问问阿瑟 费里就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.86,0:03:05.06,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, snatched that.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 这球打急了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.66,0:03:13.36,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Fitting, but it ends in such fashion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N以这样的方式结束 也很贴切
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.66,0:03:23.10,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Zizou Bergs gets the better of Carlos Alcaraz.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N贝尔格斯击败了阿尔卡拉斯
